    question: 'How does the UAE divorce rate compare globally?',
    answer: 'A clean comparison is hard, because we could not verify a current official crude divorce rate for the whole UAE population. The closest official measure is Dubai’s crude rate for Emiratis: 2.17 divorces per 1,000 Emirati residents in 2024, counting every case involving an Emirati. For scale, the US National Center for Health Statistics reports 2.4 divorces per 1,000 population for 2023 (provisional, 45 reporting states and DC). The Dubai figure covers one nationality group in one emirate, so treat the comparison as rough.',
