          <li>Statistics Centre Abu Dhabi: Statistical Yearbook of Abu Dhabi 2020, Marriage and Divorce tables (Abu Dhabi Judicial Department data).</li>
          <li>Abu Dhabi Judicial Department: Family Guidance service page.</li>
          <li>US National Center for Health Statistics: FastStats, Marriage and Divorce (2023 provisional data), for the global comparison.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="source-note">Figures that reached the public through news coverage of official data are attributed to both the official body and the outlet. Where two reports of the same data differ, both values are shown. Legal instruments cited: Federal Decree-Law No. 41 of 2022 (civil, non-Muslim), Federal Decree-Law No. 41 of 2024 (Muslim personal status), Abu Dhabi Law No. 14 of 2021, and Federal Decree-Law No. 13 of 2024 (domestic violence).</p>
      </section>

